": "** WINNER: Audience Award: 2023 SXSW XR Experience Spotlight \n** WINNER: AIXR: 2023 Social Impact Award\n** WINNER:  Webby: 2024 AI, Metaverse & Virtual: Public Service & Activism\n** WINNER:  Webby People's Voice: 2024 AI, Metaverse & Virtual: Public Service & Activism\n** WINNER:  Games For Change: Best in XR\n** NOMINEE: Emmy: 2023 Outstanding Emerging Media Program\n** NOMINEE: 2024 Producers Guild Awards: Innovation Award\n\nIt\u2019s been sixty years since Dr. Martin Luther King delivered his iconic \"I Have a Dream\" speech, but the messages from that speech resonate today.  \n \n\u201cMLK: Now is the Time\u201d is an immersive journey that explores key themes of Dr. King's speech and highlights systemic inequities that persist in our society. Through first-person stories and interactions, \u201cMLK: Now is the Time\u201d drops you into a thoroughly modern interpretation of a contemporary March on Washington that will inform and inspire a new generation of activists. ", "short_description": "Dr. Martin Luther King's iconic \"I Have a Dream\" speech contains messages that still resonate today, sixty years later.  \n \n\u201cMLK: Now is the Time\u201d is an immersive journey that explores key themes of Dr. King's speech and highlights systemic inequities that persist in our society. Through first-person stories and interactions, \u201cMLK: Now is the Time\u201d drops you into a thoroughly modern interpretation of a contemporary March on Washington that will inform and inspire a new generation of activists."}]}, "developer_name": "Flight School Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.flightschoolstudio.com/now-is-the-time-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TIME Immersive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://time.com/nowisthetime/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": 